				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T08:05:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T06:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんかん　ね……▼
この特性の　ポケモンは
戦闘で　メロメロに　ならないんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T10:12:39" />
