	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_045"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すなおこし　ね……▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
せんとうに　でるだけで　てんきを▽
すなあらしに　してしまえるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:17:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T06:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すなおこし　ね……▼
この特性の　ポケモンは
戦闘に　でるだけで　天候を▽
すなあらしに　してしまえるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T10:33:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T06:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>すなおこし</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T08:46:58" />
