	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_138"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねつぼうそう　ね……▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
やけどに　なると▽
とくこうが　あがるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T03:22:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T06:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねつぼうそう　ね……▼
この特性の　ポケモンは
やけどに　なると▽
特攻が　あがるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T11:09:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
